官方 manifest 通过 `<linkfile>` 把以下目录映射到 openvela 工作区：

```text
app/k7host       -> apps/examples/k7host
app/gimbal       -> apps/examples/gimbal
app/k7npu        -> apps/examples/k7npu
app/k7radio      -> apps/examples/k7radio
app/k7usb        -> apps/examples/k7usb
